### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Add your own requests here for the rules in ASSIGNMENT.md

### 8. Booking starts in the past (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "past",
  "startUtc": "2020-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 9. Booking longer than 4 hours (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "long",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-11T14:00:00.001Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 10. Exactly 4 hours (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "four-hours",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-11T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 11. Touching interval (ends exactly when new booking starts, expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "touching",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 12. Cancel already cancelled booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 13. Cancel missing booking (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### 14. Reuse interval after cancellation (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "after-cancel",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### R10. Create a room with capacity greater than 10
# @name createLargeRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Large study room",
  "capacity": 11
}

###
@largeRoomId = {{createLargeRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### R10. Exactly 2 hours for a capacity 11 room (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "large-room-exact",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-12T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-12T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 11
}

### R10. Longer than 2 hours for a capacity 11 room (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "large-room-long",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-13T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-13T12:00:00.001Z",
  "attendees": 11
}
